//    - offset 4: Uint16 value 0xCAFE in LITTLE endian (littleEndian = true)
//    - offset 6: Int32 value -1 in BIG endian
//    - offset 10: Float64 value 2.718 in LITTLE endian
// 3. Read them back with the SAME endianness and return the values
